{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poppidemic is a unique roguelike about a contagious balloon disease.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AIRBORNE VIRUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/4ff043db012e4940bad70b54ac07cc03.poster.avif?t=1763505139\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/4ff043db012e4940bad70b54ac07cc03.webm?t=1763505139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/4ff043db012e4940bad70b54ac07cc03.mp4?t=1763505139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop the infected balloons before the virus spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR FATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/c5347307cdf395841964ff759afda7b4.poster.avif?t=1763505139\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/c5347307cdf395841964ff759afda7b4.webm?t=1763505139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/c5347307cdf395841964ff759afda7b4.mp4?t=1763505139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select between 3 Threats after every 2 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ECONOMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040380/extras/0d54e4b953cc88e55a42b70b9